 r for a Cause We Love. When: Thursday\, September 17th from 6:00 to 8:00 P
 M Where: Alayne White's Garden\, 11 Constitution Street\, Bristol Join us 
 for a Dolly Parton Inspired Americana Party at Alayne's Garden on Thursday
 \, September 17th from 6:00 to 8:00 PM for a night filled with good music
 \, dancing\, delicious appetizers\, and a raffle with great prizes - all t
 o support the Bristol Porchfest. For $65 per person\, enjoy a special Livi
 ng Room Session in the Garden\, featuring Michelle Saylors performing as p
 art of a beautiful Folklore x Alayne White collaboration\, along with mini
  spa experiences from Alayne White and plenty of Americana-inspired fun. I
 t's all in support of Bristol Porchfest\, so grab your friends\, put on yo
 ur best Americana/Dolly-inspired look\, and come spend a night celebrating
  music\, community\, and a great cause. Tickets available at FolkloreProvi
 sions.com.\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/americana-par
 ty-at-folklore-provisions/111748/
